        "Abstract": "This paper presents Multi2ConvAI, a multilingual and cross-lingual conversational AI dataset for task-oriented dialog (TOD) systems. The dataset is created by translating the MultiWOZ 2.1 dataset to four languages: Arabic, Chinese, German, and Russian. The paper evaluates the performance of several state-of-the-art models on the dataset and demonstrates the challenges of cross-lingual transfer for TOD tasks."
